9", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499314641_2334058800454382_6810420958056556067_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=DpLw1q7lf1sQ7kNvwGghoXO&_nc_oc=AdrUZlPfANbDTWY0qtedItlui013_hATVGkuPQvzfd1CGJALtO4IQegceg9fJia4Tc0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMrqdpUlRNGWoGHsZdjb2Z2iUEVE7yIM3wpfZh7kEVGGg&oe=6AC64A5B"}, {"file_name": "com.onenightcircus.fields-20251218-203353.png", "id": "1290753326156435", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499312236_1290753329489768_4332884711738293422_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=DeflTGe8cokQ7kNvwEz2VUO&_nc_oc=Ado9Z5DvYfj8pwBtkjyf2jyIUdEeuIoiWDYHXiEzKYWgIdKbSTuc0o_tRV9sLsKAr9E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOhmVyMUjMyahaVlaIQXWIBwgD6_X9zWClmtvk_53o95g&oe=6AC64A01"}, {"file_name": "com.onenightcircus.fields-20251218-203201.png", "id": "1926405484733596", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499312338_1926405491400262_5342535590335345652_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=282yrlMBThsQ7kNvwHe6fOO&_nc_oc=AdpQXUq7OkOdPso3tKAA12Ah9z29Ifp2xb-W3G_ruRb0TB_yqiNlaGjSaIYzg6VBICo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOwsya8s7lqZc1g020qbVvmU23WYpYFHZO1rxFSensubg&oe=6AC66E1D"}, {"file_name": "com.onenightcircus.fields-20251218-203301.png", "id": "974613512240519", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499312470_974613515573852_1573452143751525995_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=igcGGeGaJEEQ7kNvwECHfCU&_nc_oc=AdqwTp8uakRsf8NbC1OT8KoMbobxQl00fKRCujQU-2IAh8bG3OK9Hje2loB79aEFmfM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNyYVdI-lWpE4xI3BJtiD6RmIqOPYZfrRYBOlVNXKqchA&oe=6AC66FFF"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "fields-artwork-v2-2560x1440.png", "id": "1690141432030718", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499311597_1690141435364051_2132099073325899983_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Uf3H-67V9McQ7kNvwH45X8s&_nc_oc=Adr-Jw8Eg4dfCLZOL1r8qI5JE-hIP7Ce_L-MKlndBmjH0TpzrSgOloCqeq6KrnGDqqc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMiYSLMDGaggiyjubEpEVibBSis2WKsm4e4hPWynpzFhw&oe=6AC6646E"}, "display_name": "Fields", "keywords": ["music", "inmersive", "art", "visuals", "meditation"], "long_description": "Fields is not an album you listen to. It is a place you enter.\n\nAn immersive VR experience built around the music of electronic producer Die Stadt, Fields dissolves the boundary between sound and space. Each track becomes an environment: shifting fields of light, generative textures, and slow chromatic movements that respond to the music in real time.\n\nFields is designed for deep listening \u2014 a rare kind of attention that VR makes possible. No narrative, no objectives. Only presence.\nWhat you will find inside:\n\n- A full-length electronic music album experienced as a living, breathing space.\n- Generative visuals that evolve with the music.\n- Designed for extended, contemplative sessions.\n- Optimized for Meta Quest 3.\n\nFields is an album. Fields is a place. Now you can enter both.\n\nStep in.\n{1548057873348580}", "short_description": "Step inside the music of electronic/ambient producer Die Stadt. Sound becomes space. Space becomes music."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "uba_APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE.png", "id": "2273186383217800", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499307451_2273186386551133_8686410893456982869_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=midMBxGlWm4Q7kNvwH0pIdV&_nc_oc=AdrRpp8JQiaM4948ZB7Sm-by9uIlMQ-9LSvqeqNV4aRM6eP_8qD7aEIPQ7Et-vdaP-8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQM4vVwKF0nUtkvfIh2jpTCoiAlTchP6EUSNoQ_iKaSPOw&oe=6AC65D5F"}, {"file_name": "fields_logotipo_512x512.png", "id": "2080711572861858", "image_type": "APP_IMG_L